msgid ""
"It is capable of fully autonomous flight and includes the RC transmitter, "
"the battery and even telemetry, at $750.00 it is a real bargain."
msgstr "它能够完全自主飞行，包含遥控发射机、电池，甚至数传，售价750美元，物超所值。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:173
#: eef72ae3a76940559900827147d0a90f
msgid ""
"The Iris structurally strong and resilient and it is set up to support a "
"GoPro camera or even FPV (First Person View) when you are ready."
msgstr "Iris结构强固、有弹性，当您准备好时可以支持GoPro相机甚至FPV（第一人称视角）。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:181
#: 25edba353a4f42c3a0f62c2c625ca9c1
msgid "Almost Ready to Fly"
msgstr "接近即飞型"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:183
#: beea647489c04a0d8197afa263a4e334
msgid ""
"If you need everything and want the most versatile copter possible you can't"
" beat the Iris above, it is simply a great deal."
msgstr "如果您需要一切并想要最通用的飞行器，上面的Iris是您的不二之选，它简直是超值。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:185
#: 9e29e6cd8b024338834e41d99ad967e3
msgid ""
"If you already have a RC transmitter you can save some money and still build"
