msgstr "如果您已有遥控发射机，可以省下一些钱，同时仍能制作一架高质量的自主四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:187
#: ef23ef6bed2e4dbdb7eba01d9f6f6f71
msgid "Even if you are just starting there are a few really good choices."
msgstr "即使您是初学者，也有几个非常好的选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:189
#: e5255a7010854ade89da593180bbf1a1
msgid ""
"The **DJI F450 Flamewheel QuadCopter ARF Kit** may well be single the best "
"choice at this time."
msgstr "**DJI F450 Flamewheel四轴飞行器ARF套件** 目前可能是最佳单一选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:191
#: 2d591b4e27ee435ca70d507c1e6a8585
msgid ""
"This kit comes with frame with built in power distribution board, the 4 "
