msgstr "费用：F450 ARF套件180美元，带GPS/罗盘的Pixhawk 280美元，电池35美元 = 495美元，另需PPM-Sum接收机。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:201
#: e0cc56d006944208879e29c204d3c330
msgid ""
"As an alternative, the smaller **DJI F330 Flamewheel Quadcopter** is also an"
