msgstr ":ref:`关于F330制作的Wiki页面 <dji-f330-flamewheel>` 同样适用于 **F450**。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:207
#: 516030f61726428d8bf691aa67faaaa8
msgid ""
"Most ARF kits that are cheaper than this are not nearly as sturdy and the "
