msgstr "大多数比这便宜的ARF套件远没有这么坚固，零部件失效也更加频繁。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:209
#: 1d83b1d8308d43f0acb774cd76d529f1
msgid ""
"You can buy the `F450 ARF kit Here! "
"<http://www.amainhobbies.com/product_info.php/cPath/2_382_2405_3233_3237/products_id/235232/n/DJI-"
"Innovations-Flame-Wheel-F450-ARF-Quadcopter-Kit-w-Motors-ESC-Propellers>`__ "
"This source has the **F350 ARF** kit also."
msgstr ""
"您可以 `在这里购买F450 ARF套件！ "
"<http://www.amainhobbies.com/product_info.php/cPath/2_382_2405_3233_3237/products_id/235232/n/DJI-"
"Innovations-Flame-Wheel-F450-ARF-Quadcopter-Kit-w-Motors-ESC-Propellers>`__ "
"该来源也有 **F350 ARF** 套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:211
#: 108a8050ad9f49099022720c1c97faab
msgid ""
"DO NOT get a clone kit that looks like it, the real DJI motors and ESCs are "
