msgstr "不要购买看起来相似的仿制套件，真正的DJI电机和ESC质量上乘，机架坚硬强固，而仿制品则不然。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:214
#: e7f8ea9a6e754e8f952a69d1d1417ca1
msgid ""
"There are more expensive high quality ARF kits available but the FlameWheels"
" will give great service and have very high performance."
msgstr "还有更昂贵的高质量ARF套件，但FlameWheel将提供卓越的服务和非常高的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:216
#: f215dfd470f94eef89eb2c07b03afbd7
msgid ""
"If you want to keep initial cost to a bare minimum, start with a `Simple "
"Flight Controller "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__24723__Hobbyking_KK2_0_Multi_rotor_LCD_Flight_Control_Board.html>`__"
" then graduate to a `Pixhawk <https://store.3dr.com/products/3dr-pixhawk>`__"
" when you are ready"
msgstr ""
"如果您想将初始成本降至最低，可以先使用 `简易飞控 "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__24723__Hobbyking_KK2_0_Multi_rotor_LCD_Flight_Control_Board.html>`__，然后在准备好时升级到"
" `Pixhawk <https://store.3dr.com/products/3dr-pixhawk>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:221
#: 87aa41bd6d894e3ab143580db904fc84
msgid ""
"The F450 can also serve as a competent Gopro and Gimbal carrying photo and "
"video copter or as an FPV platform."
msgstr "F450也可以作为称职的GoPro和云台拍照视频飞行器，或作为FPV平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:223
#: 137a9aabee1f4b03a8023fbf756ac4a7
msgid ""
"The **DJI F550 ARF Hexacopter** is a good choice for more advanced uses, but"
" it is not ideal as a first MultiCopter."
msgstr "**DJI F550 ARF六轴飞行器** 是更高级用途的好选择，但它不适合作为第一架多旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:230
#: 6883b4bb3de84b36842918d15cfb1efe
