msgstr "例外情况是您严格按照某个特定的详细制作指南操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:237
#: 300b849b8d114bc8a2485140d03d965d
msgid ""
"I am working on 2 Frame Kit based builds at the moment, a Flip 380 Sport "
"QuadCopter and a Tarot 650 Carbon Fiber Quadcopter."
msgstr "我目前正在制作两款基于机架套件的产品：Flip 380 Sport四轴飞行器和Tarot 650碳纤维四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:239
#: d190229b37454573a12ee42071bd2810
msgid ""
"A little bit on the reasons for and methods used in each of the Builds."
msgstr "简要说明每个制作的原因和使用的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:241
#: b0fe58213a2743eaa2e7239212c382f1
msgid ""
"The Hoverthings \\ `Flip 380 Sport <http://www.hoverthings.com/the-flip-"
"black>`__ Frame is billed as the most indestructible frame ever."
msgstr ""
"Hoverthings \\ `Flip 380 Sport <http://www.hoverthings.com/the-flip-"
"black>`__ 机架被宣传为有史以来最坚不可摧的机架。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:244
#: 1f0ce98774a9474d8c3fc58f6861332e
msgid ""
"It uses incredibly stiff and strong CNC machined 1/4\" thick Fiberglass arms"
" and G10 Fiberglass center plates."
msgstr "它使用令人难以置信的坚硬强固的CNC加工1/4英寸厚玻璃纤维机臂和G10玻璃纤维中央板。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:246
#: fc6cdbc6cef64c69a6beb9aed37cd349
msgid ""
"It can incorporate the same motors and ESCs as used in the DJI Flamewheel "
"and can use up to 10\" propellers."
msgstr "它可以使用与DJI Flamewheel相同的电机和ESC，并可使用最大10英寸的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:248
#: 818df0ad78f84e5582abddf7adca32c8
msgid ""
"I purchased the Flip Sport Kit plus an extra pair of \"tab\" type center "
"sections and extra 7/8\" spacers."
msgstr "我购买了Flip Sport套件以及额外的一对\"tab\"型中央板和额外的7/8英寸支撑柱。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:250
#: 13e61a67c1354f9cb5006967c613d4d2
msgid ""
"The extra center plates mount below the stock plates on 7/8\" spacers to "
"accommodate the battery and flight gear."
msgstr "额外的中央板通过7/8英寸支撑柱安装在标准板下方，用于容纳电池和飞行设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:252
#: 33097ddc5c8f4e2caff2ec4b26fd4b39
msgid ""
"I am using 4 of the stock DJI Flamewheel motors and a special `4 in 1 ESC "
"<http://mymobilemms.com/OFFTHEGRIDWATER.CA/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=2_4&products_id=203>`__"
" placed between the center plates of the copter."
msgstr ""
"我使用4个标准DJI Flamewheel电机和一个特殊的 `四合一ESC "
"<http://mymobilemms.com/OFFTHEGRIDWATER.CA/index.php?main_page=product_info&cPath=2_4&products_id=203>`__，放置在飞行器的中央板之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:258
#: 9a39d5e73b82463c9eb1d4b165184bac
msgid ""
"The 4 in 1 ESC produces much less RF and DC interference and is neater than "
"4 ESCs and a power distribution board."
msgstr "四合一ESC产生的射频和直流干扰远少于4个单独的ESC加配电板，也更整洁。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:260
#: c3b6aef87c6d4735b6683100237756c9
msgid ""
"I am using `GemFan DJI hub compatible 10\" carbon filled propellers "
"<http://www.rcdude.com/servlet/the-2498/GemFan-DJI-Hub-10x4.5/Detail>`__ "
"because they are very tough and very efficient."
msgstr ""
"我使用 `GemFan DJI轮毂兼容10英寸碳填充螺旋桨 "
"<http://www.rcdude.com/servlet/the-2498/GemFan-DJI-"
"Hub-10x4.5/Detail>`__，因为它们非常坚韧且效率很高。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:262
#: 799afe67e5a949feb56e7ab10bd5da79
msgid ""
"My goal is to build an even tougher and higher performance copter than the "
"DJI F450 Flamewheel - inexpensively."
msgstr "我的目标是以较低成本制作一架比DJI F450 Flamewheel更坚固、性能更高的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:264
#: 85261197a0424aa597427e262cbeeb7b
msgid ""
"Although it's a small copter the Flip is powerful and agile enough to use "
"FPV video and/or a GoPro Camera and brushless gimbal."
msgstr "虽然是小型飞行器，但Flip功率和灵活性足以使用FPV视频和/或GoPro相机及无刷云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:266
#: 2683f356e5d3420792d9057007012f45
msgid ""
"Here is a link to the :ref:`Hoverthings Flip Sport Quadcopter Wiki Build "
"Page <hoverthings-flip-sport-quadcopter>` using a Pixhawk autopilot."
msgstr ""
"这是 :ref:`Hoverthings Flip Sport四轴飞行器Wiki制作页面 <hoverthings-flip-sport-"
"quadcopter>` 的链接，使用Pixhawk飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:271
#: 29729a1150464cc9b0e0fbaa252f98cf
msgid ""
"The `Tarot 650 <http://www.ebay.com/itm/Tarot-Iron-"
"Man-650-Foldable-3K-carbon-fiber-Quad-copter-Quadcopter-Frame-"
"TL65B02-/151050276421>`__ is a carbon fiber frame that is quite large for a "
"QuadCopter and it can incorporate up to 17\" propellers."
msgstr ""
"`Tarot 650 <http://www.ebay.com/itm/Tarot-Iron-Man-650-Foldable-3K-carbon-"
"fiber-Quad-copter-Quadcopter-Frame-TL65B02-/151050276421>`__ "
"是一款碳纤维机架，对于四轴飞行器来说相当大，可以容纳最大17英寸的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:275
#: 49f9be4ce3b34590bacecfebd8ac5728
msgid ""
"I am using 360kv slow speed, large diameter \\ **Pancake Motors** designed "
"to turn the more efficient large propellers at low speeds."
msgstr "我使用360KV低速、大直径 **扁平电机**，专为以低速驱动效率更高的大螺旋桨而设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:278
#: c13f84a50e8f4c00af0dac5f6d4c0263
msgid ""
"I will be using a variety of 14\" to 17\" propellers to explore performance "
"and efficiency at various propeller diameters."
msgstr "我将使用各种14英寸到17英寸的螺旋桨，探索不同螺旋桨直径下的性能和效率。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:280
#: 47e89fae751542079c271663c8c3b65a
msgid ""
"Although the Flip Sport build shown above could be appropriate for a first "
"QuadCopter, this Tarot 650 build is definitely not."
msgstr "虽然上面展示的Flip Sport制作可能适合第一架四轴飞行器，但这款Tarot 650制作绝对不适合。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:282
#: f982a8b7419f4255846283b979775837
msgid ""
"This quad is big enough to serve as a heavy lift or long endurance copter or"
" to carry a big video or still camera, but:"
msgstr "这架四轴飞行器足够大，可以用作重载或长续航飞行器，或搭载大型视频或静态相机，但："

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:285
#: d3c215d4f52e486c9056a985e441524e
msgid ""
"For lifting a 2KG payload with a quadcopter you need some serious motor and "
"some serious prop."
msgstr "要用四轴飞行器提升2千克载荷，您需要强力电机和大型螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:287
#: 1d40952b12fd46fc85d7757bb2315369
msgid ""
"`Four Tigermotor MN4010 475 KV motors "
"<http://www.rctigermotor.com/html/2013/Navigator_0910/38.html>`__ at $86.00 "
"each, four 15 x 5 or 16 x 5 props and four high quality 30 amp ESCs."
msgstr ""
"`四个Tigermotor MN4010 475KV电机 "
"<http://www.rctigermotor.com/html/2013/Navigator_0910/38.html>`__，每个86美元，四个15×5或16×5螺旋桨以及四个高质量30安培ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:290
#: 3005988a48254fc5a25a9480940af8d0
msgid ""
"It needs 10,000mah of 4 cell Lipo batteries (two 5000's) to achieve "
"approximately ~10 minutes of flight time at 4KG total weight."
msgstr "在总重4千克时，需要10000毫安时4节LiPo电池（两块5000毫安时）才能实现约10分钟的飞行时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:293
#: 0cdf1ccc03ba4da4a87b6b55fb9705aa
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"It should be capable of lifting 4 KG total (including 2KG payload) and leave"
" about 50% reserve thrust (minimum needed) (6kg total)."
msgstr "它应该能够提升4千克总重（含2千克载荷）并保留约50%推力储备（最低需求）（总共6千克）。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:296
#: f0a7a753a75149f3917cd83e4e80c7a7
msgid ""
"You will need 16\" x 5  props to achieve the thrust and efficiency necessary"
" to lift 4KG total with reasonable flight times."
msgstr "您需要16×5螺旋桨才能达到在合理飞行时间内提升4千克总重所需的推力和效率。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:299
#: 0377fceebf0b47ee884a65d463b50e13
msgid ""
"That is why the bigger motors with the lower KV are required and they need "
"to be high quality to withstand continuous high output."
msgstr "这就是为什么需要低KV大电机，并且它们需要高质量以承受持续的大功率输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:302
#: 1e23ac8c535445029175a08453146634
msgid ""
"It is very highly recommended that you do not attempt to construct one of "
"these for your first build."
msgstr "强烈建议您不要尝试将其作为第一个制作项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:305
#: d3bf161e8fdb4c98ad6d9e4c55d99009
msgid ""
"A really handy link for quickly calculating performance requirements for "
"various multicopters and components: `eCalc "
"<http://www.ecalc.ch/indexcalc.htm>`__"
msgstr ""
"一个快速计算各种多旋翼飞行器及组件性能需求的实用链接：`eCalc <http://www.ecalc.ch/indexcalc.htm>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:312
#: f132d1699f174a0e80df83766fc545f9
msgid ""
"**Or Perhaps a really tiny little `250 sized $10.00 frame "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__47075__HobbyKing_FPV250_Quad_Copter_A_Mini_Sized_FPV_Multi_Rotor_kit_.html>`__"
" with FPV capability you can fly indoors or out.**"
msgstr ""
"**或者可能是一款真正微小的 `250尺寸10美元机架 "
"<http://www.hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__47075__HobbyKing_FPV250_Quad_Copter_A_Mini_Sized_FPV_Multi_Rotor_kit_.html>`__，具备FPV能力，可以室内室外飞行。**"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:322
#: 2d1c959905544828ad92a0e88d190d18
msgid "Scratch Built"
msgstr "从零开始自制"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:324
#: fe4a9482a876414eae20c60aa97074f2
msgid ""
"Although this is often attempted by those who have never used a multicopter,"
" it very seldom turns out well."
msgstr "虽然从未使用过多旋翼飞行器的人经常尝试这样做，但很少有好的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:326
#: 526ac3ce6f244418bbe7621b3dc3a79b
msgid ""
"At the simplest level a functioning QuadCopter can be built out of sticks or"
" dowels and plywood that will fly."
msgstr "在最简单的层面上，可以用木棍或圆木棒和胶合板制作一架能飞的四轴飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:328
#: 0cfab86fa34a49e7b379ecb042ba84c9
msgid ""
"But it is very unlikely to fly well or to be very serviceable or to well "
"tolerate less than perfect \"landings\"."
msgstr "但它不太可能飞得好，也不太实用，对非完美的\"着陆\"也不够耐受。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:330
#: 246464aea8bb44b8b63b83a337734d92
msgid ""
"And this is no way to save money, RTF, Kits and ARF include high quality "
"matched components and actually cost less."
msgstr "而且这绝不是省钱的方式，RTF、套件和ARF包含高质量匹配组件，实际上成本更低。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:332
#: 026127fcc58347438206300c44e9084a
msgid ""
"Even if you are an experienced model builder, machinist or engineer, DO NOT "
"START HERE!"
msgstr "即使您是经验丰富的模型制作者、机械师或工程师，**不要从这里开始！**"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:334
#: e7077ac06efe4144930f4bdc52f1b676
msgid ""
"Multicopters have their whole own set of flight dynamics and structural "
"demands."
msgstr "多旋翼飞行器有其独特的飞行动力学和结构要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:336
#: b3a0321507e34cdcb62794e2224074a4
msgid ""
"Until you have become experienced with them you stand virtually no chance of"
" designing and making a worthwhile MultiCopter."
msgstr "在您对它们有了足够经验之前，您几乎没有机会设计并制作一架有价值的多旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:338
#: d4408cf6153a46e2a0e510958c9ad3ba
msgid ""
"There is a really lovely QuadCopter design made by a newbie from bent sheet "
"aluminum on our site right now."
msgstr "目前我们网站上有一款由新手用弯制铝板制作的精美四轴飞行器设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:340
#: a77423d80fad4beba8db8a5cb425aa94
msgid ""
"Unfortunately sheet aluminum is soft, the copter is heavy and hard landings "
"are common so a very bent copter is inevitable."
msgstr "不幸的是铝板质地软，飞行器很重，硬着陆很常见，因此飞行器弯曲变形是不可避免的。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:342
#: cfbf8dfe894b440a83064b9afba2547d
msgid ""
"Even if you are very experienced, you will certainly need to make several "
"copters before you achieve a worthwhile design."
msgstr "即使您经验非常丰富，也肯定需要制作几架飞行器才能实现有价值的设计。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:344
#: b9cd407def8e4752b0beff41c13cd071
msgid ""
"I won't say Experts only, but you really need to go through at least 3 or 4 "
"commercial MultiCopters before you even think about doing this."
msgstr "我不会说只有专家才能做，但在考虑这样做之前，您真的需要经历至少3到4架商用多旋翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:347
#: 8c7d922d7cdb4852864bc28b66c5232f
msgid ""
"I have made over a dozen different CAD designs so far and have not yet built"
" one, I will make one, but I'm not ready yet and I know it."
msgstr "到目前为止我做了十几个不同的CAD设计，还没有制作任何一个。我会做，但我还没准备好，我知道。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:351
#: bf92c5d9082d445d93eeb526e5a9aacd
msgid "Brand Name Ready to Fly"
msgstr "品牌名称即飞型"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:353
#: d767d10f426842a48d23d1c9816763eb
msgid ""
"A few words about the **Brand Name** Ready To Fly QuadCopters like the "
"**Parrot**, the **DJI Phantom** and the **Blade 350QX**."
msgstr ""
"简单介绍一下 **品牌名称** 即飞型四轴飞行器，如 **Parrot**、**DJI Phantom** 和 **Blade 350QX**。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:356
#: f086303371e04a02bb585f40f3aae78d
msgid ""
"Within the scope of their capabilities these are generally well made and "
"often a reasonable bargain for what they do."
msgstr "在其能力范围内，这些通常制作精良，对于所提供的功能通常也物有所值。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:358
#: 42e74c8bf5e44406b91d996f66db9c8c
msgid ""
"But they are also not easily modified or improved on and are not easy to "
"upgrade to a more powerful autopilot like the Pixhawk."
msgstr "但它们也不容易改装或改进，也不容易升级到更强大的飞控如Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:360
#: 2d53bed6c22a4b64819120dd6a8f6c3b
msgid ""
"So although they are a moderately capable one stop solution, they can also "
"be a bit of a costly dead end."
msgstr "因此，虽然它们是中等能力的一站式解决方案，但也可能是有些昂贵的死胡同。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:362
#: bc14cc5da1da40ad8ddd8c3b16478c56
msgid ""
"You can put together a **Flamewheel ARF kit** with a top end **Pixhawk "
"autopilot** for about the same money and be way ahead."
msgstr "您可以用大致相同的价格将 **Flamewheel ARF套件** 与顶级 **Pixhawk飞控** 组合，效果要好得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:367
#: a49f1371a47c4910adcb63f167527bb0
msgid "Which Approach is Right for You"
msgstr "哪种方式适合您"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:369
#: 65dae2092d5048b295f038f2b776caf0
msgid ""
"It is very important to match your approach to your capability level, if you"
" overreach you can end up with a negative experience."
msgstr "将您的方法与您的能力水平相匹配非常重要，如果超出能力范围，可能会有负面体验。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:371
#: 6d7a721c72e44c5ca7a5530e6bf10f52
msgid ""
"It is also much more important to take a robust and conservative approach "
"than to try to do everything the first time out."
msgstr "采取稳健和保守的方法也比第一次就尝试做所有事情重要得多。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:374
#: 40ffdc6fbbff429cb365bebb3cae04ed
msgid ""
"The simplest approach is to get a **Ready to Fly** system or an **All "
"Inclusive Kit**."
msgstr "最简单的方法是购买 **即飞型** 系统或 **全套套件**。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:376
#: c78d54a4cf4844d88c0708e67f92b9f8
msgid ""
"However, a good **Almost Ready To Fly** kit plus some carefully chosen "
"components can also result in an outstanding copter."
msgstr "然而，好的 **接近即飞型** 套件加上精心选择的组件也可以产生出色的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:378
#: 70cb7e9abb8347019a469de3450080f6
msgid ""
"The ARF approach can often cost somewhat less and enable you to construct a "
"copter that is specifically tailored to your needs."
msgstr "ARF方法通常成本较低，并使您能够构建专门针对您需求定制的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:380
#: 621ea53891e04d0881dcefffb8712aa9
msgid ""
"The **Frame Kit** approach presumes that you have sufficient knowledge to "
"specify appropriate components that will work together."
msgstr "**机架套件** 方法假定您有足够的知识来指定能协同工作的适当组件。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:383
#: 1b408d3e7dbf48738346b01766386708
msgid ""
"But it does let you put together a copter that is specifically optimized for"
" your needs and desires."
msgstr "但它确实让您能够组装一架专门针对您的需求和愿望优化的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:385
#: 4c6207c33eaa4417a347c209c79121e7
msgid ""
"Unless you find and scrupulously follow a comprehensive article detailing a "
"specific \"build\" a Frame Kit should not be your first copter."
msgstr "除非您找到并严格遵循一篇详细描述特定\"制作\"的综合文章，否则机架套件不应该是您的第一架飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:388
#: 675b519b37ae4d62a4a7d23371a6e514
msgid ""
"Clearly that goes double for **Scratch Built**. It isn't actually all that "
"hard to build a MultiCopter frame."
msgstr "显然，**从零自制** 更是如此。制作多旋翼飞行器机架实际上并不那么难。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:390
#: d8be5e21d4b34283a10b6fd6a61793aa
msgid ""
"But the overall process and component matching to make it work well is "
"really for the experienced MultiCopter operator / builder."
msgstr "但使其良好运行的整体流程和组件匹配确实是有经验的多旋翼操作者/制作者才适合的。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:393
#: 044183ccc98a4bc983828d8a7265970b
msgid ""
"There are expensive, high end Multicopters, which are generally oriented to "
"commercial photo or video use and outside our scope here."
msgstr "有昂贵的高端多旋翼飞行器，通常面向商业摄影或视频用途，超出了我们在此讨论的范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:395
#: 210c50f48a43453a83a26989200ba203
msgid ""
"All of the Copters I have and will be putting together incorporate a "
":ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>` autopilot"
msgstr "我所拥有和将要组装的所有飞行器都配备 :ref:`Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>` 飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:398
#: 41da3ed0dfae453295f6c31edaafef3a
msgid ""
"These are the best and most capable autopilots available and they have great"
" **DIYDrones** community support."
msgstr "这是目前最优秀、功能最强大的飞控，具有出色的 **DIYDrones** 社区支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:400
#: 5e770de2ea534e20a66587d5da119c9e
msgid ""
"Beware of clones and counterfeits, they often have small differences that "
"end up making them completely unusable."
msgstr "注意克隆品和仿冒品，它们通常有细微差异，最终使其完全无法使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/build-your-own-multicopter.rst:402
#: 04ffcc1830904e269cdf1ca3ad8cd1e5
msgid ""
"Don't say I didn't warn you: \"Caveat Emptor\" and \"You get what you pay "
"for\"."
msgstr "我提醒过您：\"买者自慎\"和\"一分钱一分货\"。"
